---
description: Use lodash isNil instead of != null / == null
globs: src/**/*.{ts,tsx}
alwaysApply: false
---

# Null / undefined checks

- Forbidden: `x != null`, `x == null`.
- Prefer: `isNil(x)` / `!isNil(x)` from `lodash`.
- When null and undefined must differ: use `=== null` or `=== undefined` explicitly.
- Prefer optional chaining (`x?.y`) when the left side may be nullish.
- ESLint `eqeqeq` is on — always `===` / `!==` for value comparisons.
